homtom is released under more than one licence, depending on the part.

| Part | Licence | Text |
|---|---|---|
| Kernel patches, board file, kernel modules (`kernel/`) | GPL-2.0-only | `LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt` |
| All other original code: `userland/`, `tools/`, `panel/`, `gateway/`, `emulator/`, `scripts/`, `workspace/`, firmware tooling, documentation | MIT (the text below) | `LICENSES/MIT.txt` |
| Brand artwork (`brand/`, except fonts) | CC-BY-4.0 | `brand/LICENSE` |
| Poppins fonts (`brand/fonts/`) | SIL OFL 1.1, unchanged | `brand/fonts/OFL.txt` |
| Third-party sources in the tree | Their own licences | `NOTICE` |

Code that is linked into or loaded by the kernel stays GPL-2.0-only. Where a
file carries an `SPDX-License-Identifier` line, that line decides. Where it
carries an upstream copyright header, that header decides.

TomTom is a trademark of its owner. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by TomTom, and it ships no TomTom software, maps or firmware.

